# LYNX .gitignore
#
# Data, logs, models and caches are pipeline OUTPUT, not source: they are large (data/ alone is multiple GB),
# regenerable from the ingesters/pipelines in this repo, and specific to the machine that produced them (paths,
# timing evidence). None of it belongs in version control. config.py is the only place a path is defined; nothing
# here should ever need to special-case a path that isn't already covered by one of these directories.

# --- secrets -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
!.env.example

# --- data: raw archives, processed features, checkpoints (see config.py for the canonical paths) ----------------
# DATA_NOTES.md is hand-maintained documentation, not pipeline output -- tracked despite living under data/raw/.
# (A trailing-slash directory exclude can't be re-included by a later "!" rule; excluding its top-level contents
# with "/*" instead keeps the negation below working, and still excludes every archive subdirectory and _manifests/
# _logs/_publication, since each is itself a top-level entry directly under data/raw/.)
/data/raw/*
!/data/raw/DATA_NOTES.md
/data/processed/
/data/constituents/

# --- logs and per-run evidence --------------------------------------------------------------------
/logs/
/data/raw/_logs/

# --- models: checkpoints and graph snapshots (config.py CHECKPOINT_DIR / GRAPH_SNAPSHOT_DIR) ----------------
/models/checkpoints/
/models/graph/

# --- Python -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# --- virtual environments -------------------------------------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
env/

# --- editors / OS ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- misc caches produced by tooling in this repo, not source --------------------------------------
unsloth_compiled_cache/
